                        "review": "A short, simple, but genuinely fun isometric hack-and-slash beat 'em up experience. There's nothing particularly spectacular here, but it definitely scratches an itch.\r\n\r\nI really enjoyed the combat and difficulty spikes. The game strikes a lovely balance between encouraging you to utilize all your combat abilities and just letting you have fun. Upgrading your character, timing your attacks and combat skills, kiting enemies, and using the environment to your advantage were easily the most enjoyable aspects for me.\r\n\r\nIf you're into that kind of gameplay and want a quick, entertaining experience without a huge time commitment, I'd definitely recommend it.",
